\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a cabinet in <a href=\"/wiki/Armbrust%27s_Home\" title=\"Armbrust's Home\">Armbrust's Home</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;15&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;3</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This journal is filled with sketches of dresses, notes on unusual stitches, and several intricately-detailed embroidery patterns.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715071031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1335/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15420/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3829/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818158/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.909      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   30.909      1 -total\n 40.16%   12.412      6 Template:Icon_text\n 30.30%    9.366     13 Template:Trim\n 20.76%    6.417  